//! Plots, checked against the C library.
//!
//! `plot_construct_oracle/cases.rs` is generated by
//! `tools/oracle_fixtures/plot_construct_probe.c`, which builds Plots with
//! `astPlot` from the Frames that `frame` below builds from the same ids,
//! and records the FrameSet each is, its graphics box, and points
//! transformed through it. `plot_attrs_oracle/cases.rs` is generated by
//! `tools/oracle_fixtures/plot_attrs_probe.c`, which sets and clears Plot
//! attributes and records each attribute's value and whether it is set.
//! `plot_native_oracle/cases.rs` is generated by
//! `tools/oracle_fixtures/plot_native_probe.c`, which records C's Native
//! dumps of Plots, and where points go through clipped Plots.

